{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2022-06-06 10:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION ANNOUNCES GABRIELLE BROWN AS CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER', 'text': "JOE DORREGO TO CONTINUE IN ROLE AS CHIEF OPERATING AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER OF\xa0 FOX NEWS MEDIA NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES , JUNE 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY'S NEW HEAD OF INVESTOR RELATIONS.\xa0 GABRIELLE BROWN HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF INVESTOR RELATIONS OFFICER FOR FOX CORPORATION."}